{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>關曜儁（Leo）近日在TVB節目《愛‧回家之三代同糖》的爆笑演出引起網民熱烈討論，更被眼利網民翻出他原來曾在《愛‧回家之開心速遞》分飾兩角，其搞笑功力獲一面倒激讚！不少觀眾大讚他一出場就充滿喜感，為劇集增添不少生氣。</p><p>網民洗版式力讚關曜儁：一出嚟就有喜感</p><p>關曜儁的演出獲得網民高度評價，留言區被讚賞洗版。網民紛紛表示：「Leo 一出嚟就好有喜感」、「佢其實好有喜感，好好笑」、「我一向喜歡睇關曜儁」。更有觀眾認為他的出現能帶動劇集節奏：「有佢演嘅劇好生鬼，節奏會快啲」。亦有粉絲從他過往作品就已留意到他：「由《下流上車族》已鍾意睇佢做戲」、「佢教做運動都好睇，幾搞笑」、「佢彈出嚟嗌婉婉媽咪嗰吓我笑咗」、「今集好笑吖」、「節奏明快豐富」。</p><p>《開心速遞》分飾兩角經典重溫</p><p>隨著人氣急升，有網民翻查歷史，指出關曜儁原來是《愛‧回家》系列的熟面孔。他曾在處境劇《愛‧回家之開心速遞》中分飾兩個角色，分別是島大學生「范柳元」，以及Win Win（莊思明飾）的經理人「仇奇」。當中他飾演的「仇奇」與KC（歐瑞偉飾）展開的「寄生蟲大作戰」更是其經典代表作之一，讓不少忠實觀眾留下深刻印象。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_6509395936a7d5783a4eef.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_5857320256a7d5785d1d57.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_21210860886a7d57892993a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_15282166606a7d578c0f7f9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_15097517496a7d578f5146b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_3558737626a7d5792f3e7d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_4052381856a7d5795d110c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_9052963686a7d579978e4b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_1889959906a7d579c8394f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_7752713926a7d579f4bb36.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_1184845786a7d57a28e24f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_19577001926a7d57a5c68ce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_17503051236a7d57a8cb26b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_11137568256a7d57abaadfa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_1916365886a7d57ae6cce4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_4115594536a7d57b140e76.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_10704692816a7d57b3e7ccc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_6806688666a7d57b7ced76.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_4455920096a7d57baa7ad1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_9085436646a7d57bd8ee51.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_6591508996a7d57c118ed9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_18180027006a7d57c435a18.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_5426683126a7d57c70aa18.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_16810219716a7d57c9e91e1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_20599316926a7d57cd0581a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_7197239066a7d57d0203a8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_18962103316a7d57d379c55.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_14129728416a7d57d6d932a.jpeg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_2219407426a7d57dad7607.jpeg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : tvb即時資訊 愛‧回家之三代同糖 愛‧回家之開心速遞 關曜儁</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Aug 13 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T07:00:30.043338+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":883,"images":29,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}